The PR change is a security improvement: it removes the user-supplied `email` parameter (which previously allowed any authenticated user to cancel/resubscribe another user's Stripe subscription — a CWE-639 IDOR) and now derives the email from the authenticated user's trusted object (`request.user.object.email`). The endpoint retains `@requires(["authenticated"])`. No new authorization flaw is introduced by this change.

